LowerFuncModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Lowers a single AST Function node into an IR function: extracts Name/Params (via SplitArgs), lowers the body (children to blocks) and returns the IR function map (name/params/blocks/types).
    Provides: LowerFunc(funcNode) -> funcIR.
    DependsOn: SplitArgs, EmitSeq.
    Composition: Native include from modules/Compiler/Compiler.sir (Path: ../LowerFunc/LowerFunc.sir).
